Package: blockr.portfolio
Title: Portfolio Management Blocks for blockr
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Christoph",
           family = "Sax",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christoph@cynkra.com")
Maintainer: Christoph Sax <christoph@cynkra.com>
Description: Extends 'blockr.core' with interactive portfolio management and
    share exploration blocks. Includes an investor profile block, portfolio
    optimizer, dashboard with rich panel-based visualization, and a share
    explorer with candlestick charts. Uses echarts4r for all visualizations.
